# This repository is CRLF, and stays that way.
#
# Shell scripts are the exception and have to be: a CR on the end of the
# shebang makes the kernel look for an interpreter whose name ends in a
# carriage return, and the script fails to run at all with an error naming a
# file that plainly exists. Pinning it here means a checkout cannot break
# boot-ks8.sh whatever the machine's own settings say.
*.sh text eol=lf
